# Backend (NestJS + Sequelize)

## Imports

```typescript
// ✅ Shared models from workspace package
import { User, Event } from '@coolestprojects/database';

// ✅ Inject models in services
@InjectModel(User) private readonly userModel: typeof User
```

## Patterns

- Register new models in both `SequelizeModule.forRootAsync({ models: [...] })` and `forFeature([...])` in `app.module.ts`
- DTOs live in `backend/apps/api/src/dto/` with Swagger decorators
- Auth: JWT via `AuthModule`; protect routes with Passport guards
- File uploads: `AttachmentService` + `AzureBlobService`; SAS tokens for client-side upload
- Email: `MailerService` renders `EmailTemplate` records with Handlebars

## Testing

- Unit: `*.spec.ts` next to source; `npm run test -w @coolestprojects/api`
- E2E: `backend/apps/api/test/`; uses `DB_*_TEST` env vars; `npm run test:e2e -w @coolestprojects/api`

## Database package exports

Use `.js` extension in `packages/database/src/index.ts` exports (NodeNext ESM):

```typescript
export * from './models/user.model.js';
```
